<Detail
  title="Got my start with a landscaping business"
  description="How Cut & Care Lawn Services started Cam's path into startups."
  logo="/images/cut-and-care.png"
  logoAlt="Cut & Care Lawn Services"
>
  <p>
    In my junior year of high school I started doing small landscaping jobs for
    side cash while I was working at a retail store. As the gig developed, I
    found an opportunity to start a true business in the space.
  </p>
  <p>
    Cut &amp; Care Lawn Services existed to create a personable experience for
    homeowners in the Southeast Wisconsin area. I started out of my sedan with 0
    clients and no contacts. In 2 years, we grew to an impactful and profitable
    6-figure business with three employees.
  </p>
  <p>
    This opportunity taught me a new level of accountability and integrity,
    which ultimately allowed me to forgo college and learn to build startups
    through experience.
  </p>
  <p>For anyone who is young and thinking about starting a business... do it.</p>
</Detail>
